{"id":"nchi-bf8921","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-31ecd05e-a684-468d-a4ed-decd0e5fbc0a","text":"Done per spec, in the worktree, not committed yet.\n\n- PLAN.md: an xpo note under the intro; \"Milestones\" renamed \"Milestone history\"; the Bots capsule line is a plain bullet.\n  - M7's two open items are pointers (`nchi-eaa8de`, `nchi-c740b3`); M8 is one line pointing to epic `nchi-7fac9b`.\n  - The Deferred section is removed; the face drag is epic `nchi-54ffe9`.\n- README.md: the pointer now says open work is tracked with xpo.\n- `grep -- '- \\[ \\]' PLAN.md` finds nothing. Decisions, architecture, protocol and status-mapping sections are unchanged.\n- Docs only, so I didn't run the build or tests."},"created_at":"2026-10-02T07:42:39.135514Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
